WEBVTT

00:05:59.838 --> 00:06:04.347
If I multiply an odd number
with an even number,

00:06:05.017 --> 00:06:08.070
it ultimately becomes an even number,

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:09.830
like this one here.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:13.020
Three times four gives us 12.

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:15.158
An even number.

00:06:15.158 --> 00:06:20.608
So, odd multiplied with odd, the result
has to definitely be an odd number.

00:06:20.928 --> 00:06:26.430
But odd multiplied with something even,
no matter how many times you do it,

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:29.329
it will definitely give us an even number.

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:32.999
And I'm like, this is quite me.